<tr><th>Route</th><th>Controller</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>/items</code></td><td><code>ItemController</code></td><td>CRUD item master (<code>item_info</code>)</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>/items-by-category/{id}</code></td><td><code>ItemController</code></td><td>AJAX items by category</td></tr>
</table>
<h3>7.4 Item inventory (manual entry)</h3>
<table>
<tr><th>Route</th><th>Controller</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>/items-inventory</code></td><td><code>ItemsInventoryController</code></td><td>Create inventory (packages: main + RAM/storage/processor rows)</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>/items-inventory-list</code></td><td><code>ItemsInventoryController</code></td><td>List</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>/items-inventory-edit/{id}</code></td><td><code>ItemsInventoryController</code></td><td>Edit; loads specs by <code>set_uniq_no</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>POST update/delete/active</td><td><code>ItemsInventoryController</code></td><td>CRUD</td></tr>
</table>
<p><strong>Behaviour highlights:</strong></p>
<p>• Item select can auto-fill <strong>category</strong> (<code>data-category-id</code>) and default <strong>condition</strong> to <code>good</code>.</p>
<p>• Specifications stored as separate <code>item_inventory</code> rows with same <code>set_uniq_no</code>, <code>store_type = SP</code>.</p>
<h3>7.5 Branch Excel/CSV bulk upload</h3>
<table>
<tr><th>Route</th><th>Name</th><th>Step</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>GET /items-inventory-csv-upload</code></td><td><code>items-inventory-csv-upload</code></td><td>Select <strong>branch</strong>, upload file</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>POST /items-inventory-csv-upload-process</code></td><td><code>items-inventory-csv-upload-process</code></td><td>Parse → session preview</td></tr>
<tr><td>Preview view</td><td>—</td><td>Edit grid, confirm</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>POST /items-inventory-csv-store</code></td><td><code>items-inventory-csv-store</code></td><td>DB import + export session</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>GET /items-inventory-csv-export-result</code></td><td><code>items-inventory-csv-export-result</code></td><td>Download result Excel</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>GET /items-inventory-csv-cancel</code></td><td><code>items-inventory-csv-cancel</code></td><td>Clear session</td></tr>
</table>
<p><strong>Parser:</strong> <code>App\Support\InventorySpreadsheetImportMapper</code></p>
<p>• Detects header row and column aliases (Product Name, Serial No, Employee ID, wide matrix layouts).</p>
<p>• Formats: <strong><code>branch_inventory</code></strong>, <strong><code>wide_asset_matrix</code></strong> (Uttara-style laptop/monitor columns).</p>
<p>• <strong>Category rule (branch import):</strong> default category label <strong><code>IT Equipment</code></strong> for all preview/import rows (matched to <code>category</code> master when exists).</p>
<p>• <strong><code>SET_UNIQ_NO</code>:</strong> auto-generated in preview; conflict checks on import.</p>
<p>• <strong>Controller:</strong> <code>ItemsCsvUploadController</code> — session keys: <code>csv_preview_data</code>, <code>csv_upload_branch_id</code>, <code>csv_import_meta</code>, <code>csv_upload_export_rows</code>.</p>
<p>See also: <code>CSV_UPLOAD_IMPLEMENTATION.md</code>, <code>CSV_UPLOAD_GUIDE.md</code>.</p>
<h3>7.6 CSV receive (legacy/alternate)</h3>
<table>
<tr><th>Route</th><th>Controller</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>/items-inventory-csv-receive</code></td><td><code>ItemsCsvReceiveController</code></td></tr>
</table>
<h3>7.7 Stock out</h3>
<table>
<tr><th>Route</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>/stock-out</code>, <code>/stock-out-save-update</code></td><td>Issue items (<code>store_type = SO</code>)</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>/stock-out-list</code>, <code>/stock-out-invoice/{no}</code></td><td>Listing &amp; invoice</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>/receive-stock</code></td><td>Receive returned stock</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>/transfer-items</code></td><td>Transfer between employees (writes <code>item_transfer_logs</code>, remark on inventory)</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>/return-to-division</code></td><td>Return flow to division</td></tr>
</table>
<p><strong>Repository:</strong> <code>StockOutRepo</code> / <code>StockOutRepoImpl</code> <strong>Controller:</strong> <code>StockOutController</code> <strong>HRM:</strong> Employee lookup via <code>CommonTraits::employeeInfo()</code> → <code>PADMA_HRM_API_URL</code>.</p>
<h3>7.8 Item swap (same branch / division)</h3>
<table>
<tr><th>Route</th><th>Description</th></tr>
