<tr><td><code>POST /swap-items-save</code></td><td>Creates <code>item_swap_logs</code>, marks inventory pending</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>GET /receive-swap-items</code></td><td>Receiver confirms</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>POST /receive-swap-items-save</code></td><td>Completes swap; <code>receive_remarks</code></td></tr>
</table>
<p><strong>Repository:</strong> <code>ItemSwapRepo</code> / <code>ItemSwapRepoImpl</code> <strong>Model/table:</strong> <code>item_swap_logs</code> (status: 1 pending, 2 received, 3 cancelled)</p>
