<tr><th>Route</th><th>Controller</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>GET /barcode-generate</code>, <code>/inventory-barcode</code></td><td><code>InventoryBarcodeController@index</code></td><td>Filter form (division/branch, item, QTY, page layout)</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>POST /inventory-barcode-generate</code></td><td><code>InventoryBarcodeController@generate</code></td><td>Build CODE128 labels; preview on same page</td></tr>
<tr><td>—</td><td>Print button (JS)</td><td>Thermal-style <strong>one label per page</strong>, vertical preview</td></tr>
</table>
<p><strong>Repository:</strong> <code>InventoryBarcodeRepo</code> / <code>InventoryBarcodeRepoImpl</code> <strong>Support:</strong> <code>BarcodeLabelSizeCatalog</code> (Word/Avery-style mm sizes) <strong>Views:</strong> <code>resources/views/backend/item/inventory_barcode/</code> <strong>Oracle note:</strong> non-empty <code>SET_UNIQ_NO</code> via <code>LENGTH(TRIM(...)) &gt; 0</code>.</p>
<p>Module detail: <a href="./modules/15-inventory-barcode.md">docs/modules/15-inventory-barcode.md</a>.</p>
