<tr><td><code>/user-edit/{id}</code>, <code>/user-delete/{id}</code></td><td>Edit/delete</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>/user-active/{id}</code>, <code>/user-in-active/{id}</code></td><td>Status</td></tr>
</table>
<p><strong>Controller:</strong> <code>UsersController</code> <strong>Repo:</strong> <code>UserRepo</code> / <code>UserRepoImpl</code></p>
