<tr><th>Route</th><th>Controller</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>/user-type</code></td><td><code>UsersTypeController</code></td></tr>
</table>
<p>Field <strong><code>user_types</code></strong> on user links to permission rows.</p>
<h2>Menu permission</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Route</th><th>Controller</th></tr>
