<div class="page-break"></div><h1>Module 03 — Organization Structure</h1>
<h2>Organization</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Route</th><th>Controller</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>/organization</code></td><td><code>OrganizationController</code></td></tr>
</table>
<p><strong>Repo:</strong> <code>OrganizationRepo</code> / <code>OrganizationRepoImpl</code></p>
<h2>Branch</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Route</th><th>Controller</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>/branch</code></td><td><code>BranchController</code></td></tr>
</table>
<p><strong>Important fields:</strong> <code>hr_branch_id</code> (maps to HRM branch), <code>branch_name</code>, <code>status</code></p>
<p>Used by: inventory scoping, CSV upload branch select, stock reference prefixes.</p>
<h2>Division</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Route</th><th>Controller</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>/division</code></td><td><code>DivisionController</code></td></tr>
</table>
<h2>Department</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Route</th><th>Controller</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>/department</code></td><td><code>DepartmentController</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><code>/department-by-division-id/{id}</code></td><td>AJAX departments</td></tr>
</table>
<p><strong>Repo:</strong> <code>DivisionRepo</code>, <code>DepartmentRepo</code></p>
<h2>Data relationships (logical)</h2>
<pre>
organization (org_id)
    └── branch (branch_id / hr_branch_id)
            └── division
                    └── department
</pre>
<p>Inventory rows carry <code>org_id</code>, <code>branch_id</code>; movements may store <code>from_*</code> / <code>to_*</code> branch/division/employee.</p>
<div class="page-break"></div><h1>Module 04 — Master Data (Category, Brand, Supplier, Unit)</h1>
<h2>Category</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Route</th><th>Controller</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>/category</code></td><td><code>CategoryController</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><code>/category-import-excel</code></td><td>Excel import</td></tr>
</table>
<p><strong>Table:</strong> <code>category</code> — fields <code>category_title</code>, <code>category</code>, <code>org_id</code>, <code>status</code> <strong>Repo:</strong> <code>CategoryRepo</code> / <code>CategoryRepoImpl</code></p>
<p><strong>Branch CSV default category:</strong> <code>IT Equipment</code> (see module 07).</p>
<h2>Brand</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Route</th><th><code>/brand</code> — <code>BrandController</code></th></tr>
</table>
<p><strong>Repo:</strong> <code>BrandRepo</code> / <code>BrandRepoImpl</code></p>
<h2>Supplier</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Route</th><th><code>/supplier</code> — <code>SupplierController</code></th></tr>
</table>
<p><strong>Repo:</strong> <code>SupplierRepo</code> / <code>SupplierRepoImpl</code></p>
<h2>Unit (size)</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Route</th><th><code>/size-unit</code> — <code>UnitController</code></th></tr>
</table>
<p><strong>Repo:</strong> <code>UnitRepo</code> / <code>UnitRepoImpl</code></p>
<h2>Views</h2>
<pre>
resources/views/backend/category/category.blade.php
resources/views/backend/brand/brand.blade.php
resources/views/backend/supplier/supplier.blade.php
resources/views/backend/unit/unit.blade.php
</pre>
<h2>Typical CRUD pattern</h2>
<p>All masters follow: index → POST save-update → GET edit/delete → active/inactive (status ≠ 9).</p>
<div class="page-break"></div><h1>Module 05 — Item Master</h1>
<h2>Purpose</h2>
<p>Define catalog items (title, category, brand, supplier, image) used by inventory rows.</p>
<h2>Routes</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Route</th><th>Action</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>/items</code></td><td>List / form</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>/item-save-update</code></td><td>Save</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>/items-by-category/{categoryId}</code></td><td>JSON/list by category</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>/item-edit/{id}</code>, <code>/item-delete/{id}</code></td><td>CRUD</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>/item-active/{id}</code>, <code>/item-in-active/{id}</code></td><td>Status</td></tr>
</table>
<h2>Controller / repo</h2>
<p>• <strong>Controller:</strong> <code>ItemController</code>  </p>
<p>• <strong>Repo:</strong> <code>ItemsRepo</code> / <code>ItemsRepoImpl</code>  </p>
<p>• <strong>Table:</strong> <code>item_info</code> (primary in code; migrations may reference <code>items</code>)</p>
<h2>Item code generation</h2>
<p><code>ItemController</code> uses supplier/brand/category context and <code>UserAccessTraits::generateRandomItemCode()</code> for codes when not supplied.</p>
<h2>View</h2>
<p><code>resources/views/backend/item/item.blade.php</code></p>
<h2>Links to inventory</h2>
<p>• <code>item_inventory.item_id</code> → <code>item_info.id</code>  </p>
<p>• Item dropdown on inventory form uses <code>data-category-id</code> for UI auto-category (manual entry only; CSV uses IT Equipment rule).</p>
<div class="page-break"></div><h1>Module 06 — Item Inventory (Manual Entry)</h1>
<h2>Routes</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Route</th><th>Action</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>/items-inventory</code></td><td>Entry form</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>/items-inventory-list</code></td><td>List</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>/items-inventory-save-update</code></td><td>Create package</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>/items-inventory-edit/{id}</code></td><td>Edit</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>/items-inventory-update/{id}</code></td><td>Update</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>/items-inventory-delete/{id}</code></td><td>Soft delete (status)</td></tr>
</table>
<h2>Controller / repo</h2>
<p>• <strong>Controller:</strong> <code>ItemsInventoryController</code>  </p>
<p>• <strong>Repo:</strong> <code>ItemsInventoryRepo</code> / <code>ItemsInventoryRepoImpl</code>  </p>
<p>• <strong>Model:</strong> <code>ItemsInventoryModel</code></p>
<h2>Package model</h2>
<p>One logical device = <strong>one <code>set_uniq_no</code></strong> with multiple rows:</p>
<table>
<tr><th>Row</th><th>Typical content</th></tr>
<tr><td>Main</td><td>Desktop/Laptop item, full specs on main row</td></tr>
<tr><td>Child</td><td>RAM, Storage, Processor as separate <code>item_inventory</code> rows</td></tr>
</table>
<p>All use <strong><code>store_type = SP</code></strong>, same <code>set_uniq_no</code>.</p>
<h2>SET_UNIQ_NO</h2>
<p>Generated via <code>SetUniqNoFormatter</code> — format <code>PBL-{abbr}-{seq}</code>.</p>
<h2>Edit specifications</h2>
<p>• <code>getSetUniqNoSpecifications</code> loads all rows for a set (status ≠ 9).  </p>
<p>• Modal JS pre-selects RAM/Storage/Processor; update syncs component rows.</p>
<h2>UI behaviour</h2>
<p>• Select item → auto category from <code>item_info.category_id</code>  </p>
<p>• Default condition: <strong>good</strong></p>
<h2>Views</h2>
<p>• <code>item_inventory.blade.php</code>  </p>
<p>• <code>item_inventory_edit.blade.php</code>  </p>
<p>• <code>item_inventory_list.blade.php</code></p>
<h2>Stock in number</h2>
<p><code>StockReferencePrefixBuilder::formatStockInNumber()</code> on save where applicable.</p>
<div class="page-break"></div><h1>Module 07 — Branch CSV / Excel Upload</h1>
<h2>Routes</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>Route</th><th>Name</th></tr>
<tr><td>GET</td><td><code>/items-inventory-csv-upload</code></td><td>Upload form + branch</td></tr>
<tr><td>GET</td><td><code>/items-inventory-csv-sample/{format?}</code></td><td>Sample download</td></tr>
<tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/items-inventory-csv-upload-process</code></td><td>Parse → preview</td></tr>
<tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/items-inventory-csv-store</code></td><td>Import</td></tr>
<tr><td>GET</td><td><code>/items-inventory-csv-cancel</code></td><td>Clear session</td></tr>
<tr><td>GET</td><td><code>/items-inventory-csv-export-result</code></td><td>Result Excel</td></tr>
</table>
<h2>Controller</h2>
<p><code>ItemsCsvUploadController</code> <strong>Repo:</strong> <code>ItemsCsvUploadRepo</code> / <code>ItemsCsvUploadRepoImpl</code></p>
<h2>Parser</h2>
<p><code>App\Support\InventorySpreadsheetImportMapper</code></p>
<table>
<tr><th>Format</th><th>Detection</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>branch_inventory</code></td><td>Header row + column aliases</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>wide_asset_matrix</code></td><td>Group headers (Laptop/Monitor) + Brand/Serial subheaders</td></tr>
</table>
<h2>Session keys</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Key</th><th>Content</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>csv_preview_data</code></td><td>Rows for preview grid</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>csv_upload_branch_id</code></td><td>Selected branch</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>csv_import_meta</code></td><td>format, header row, warnings</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>csv_upload_export_rows</code></td><td>Post-import export</td></tr>
</table>
<h2>Category rule</h2>
<p><strong>All branch import rows → category <code>IT Equipment</code></strong> (match DB category id when exists). Item master match still applies for <strong>item</strong> dropdown only.</p>
<h2>SET_UNIQ_NO</h2>
<p>• Assigned in preview via <code>assignPreviewSetUniqNumbers()</code>  </p>
<p>• Import: <code>resolveSetUniqNoForImport()</code> + conflict checks  </p>
<p>• Formatter: <code>SetUniqNoFormatter</code></p>
<h2>Specs from CSV</h2>
<p>Optional columns / description parsing → RAM, Storage, Processor; <code>processSpecsFromCsv()</code> creates SP rows.</p>
<h2>Views</h2>
<p>• <code>resources/views/backend/items_csv_upload/upload.blade.php</code>  </p>
<p>• <code>resources/views/backend/items_csv_upload/preview.blade.php</code> (editable grid)</p>
<h2>Related</h2>
<p><code>ItemsCsvReceiveController</code> — alternate receive flow (<code>/items-inventory-csv-receive</code>).</p>
<p>See also: <code>CSV_UPLOAD_GUIDE.md</code>, <code>CSV_UPLOAD_IMPLEMENTATION.md</code>.</p>
