<div class="page-break"></div><h1>Module 10 — Item Swap</h1>
<h2>Purpose</h2>
<p>Same branch/division: hand off device from one employee to another with <strong>pending → receive</strong> workflow.</p>
<h2>Routes</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Route</th><th>Action</th></tr>
<tr><td>GET <code>/swap-items</code></td><td>Search employee, pick device</td></tr>
<tr><td>POST <code>/swap-items-save</code></td><td>Create swap (pending)</td></tr>
<tr><td>GET <code>/receive-swap-items/{swapNo?}</code></td><td>Receiver UI</td></tr>
<tr><td>POST <code>/receive-swap-items-save</code></td><td>Confirm with remarks</td></tr>
</table>
<h2>Controller / repo</h2>
<p>• <strong>Controller:</strong> <code>ItemSwapController</code>  </p>
<p>• <strong>Repo:</strong> <code>ItemSwapRepo</code> / <code>ItemSwapRepoImpl</code>  </p>
<p>• <strong>Model:</strong> <code>ItemSwapLogModel</code></p>
<h2>Table: item_swap_logs</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>status</th><th>Meaning</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td>Pending receive</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td>Received</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td>Cancelled</td></tr>
</table>
<p>Fields include: <code>swap_no</code>, <code>item_inventory_id</code>, <code>from_employee_id</code>, <code>to_employee_id</code>, branch/division ids, <code>remarks</code>, <code>receive_remarks</code>, <code>received_at</code>.</p>
<h2>Inventory</h2>
<p>Initiate swap marks related inventory as pending; receive completes assignment update.</p>
<h2>Views</h2>
<p>• <code>swap_items.blade.php</code>  </p>
<p>• <code>receive_swap_items.blade.php</code></p>
<h2>Migration</h2>
<p><code>database/migrations/2026_03_21_000000_create_item_swap_logs_table.php</code></p>
