<div class="page-break"></div><h1>Module 14 — Database, Codes &amp; Integrations</h1>
<h2>Primary tables (runtime)</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Table</th><th>Role</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>item_inventory</code></td><td>All stock positions &amp; SI/SO lines</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>item_info</code></td><td>Item master</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>category</code>, <code>brand</code>, <code>supplier</code></td><td>Masters</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>branch</code>, <code>division</code>, <code>department</code></td><td>Org</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>item_transfer_logs</code></td><td>Transfer audit</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>item_swap_logs</code></td><td>Swap workflow</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>users</code>, <code>access_menu</code>, <code>backend_menu</code></td><td>Auth/RBAC</td></tr>
</table>
<p><strong>Status convention:</strong> <code>status = 9</code> often means deleted/inactive; active queries use <code>status &lt;&gt; 9</code>.</p>
<h2>store_type summary</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Value</th><th>Use</th></tr>
<tr><td>SP</td><td>Inventory package / CSV import / manual entry</td></tr>
<tr><td>SI</td><td>Stock in</td></tr>
<tr><td>SO</td><td>Stock out</td></tr>
</table>
<h2>SET_UNIQ_NO</h2>
<p><strong>Class:</strong> <code>App\Support\SetUniqNoFormatter</code> Format: <code>PBL-{ABBR}-{sequence}</code> Sequence: <code>maxSequenceForOrgBranch()</code> over existing inventory (status ≠ 9).</p>
<h2>Stock numbers</h2>
<p><strong>Class:</strong> <code>App\Support\StockReferencePrefixBuilder</code> Branch/division tags + set code → <code>stock_in_no</code> / related refs.</p>
<h2>HRM API</h2>
<p><strong>Trait:</strong> <code>CommonTraits</code> <strong>Env:</strong> <code>PADMA_HRM_API_URL</code> Login → bearer token → endpoints e.g. <code>/api/v3/user-info-padmaportal?emp_id=</code> Used in stock out, transfer, swap.</p>
<h2>Oracle vs MySQL</h2>
<p>• Production: <code>yajra/laravel-oci8</code>, schema often <code>PAD_INVENTORY</code>  </p>
<p>• Local XAMPP: MySQL, run migrations + any <code>.sql</code> alters needed</p>
<h2>A–Z SQL scripts (repo)</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>File</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td><a href="../sql/PAD_INVENTORY_A_TO_Z_ORACLE.sql">docs/sql/PAD_INVENTORY_A_TO_Z_ORACLE.sql</a></td><td>Full Oracle DDL (core + logs + procurement)</td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="../sql/PAD_INVENTORY_A_TO_Z_MYSQL.sql">docs/sql/PAD_INVENTORY_A_TO_Z_MYSQL.sql</a></td><td>Full MySQL DDL for local</td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="../sql/PAD_INVENTORY_QUERIES_A_TO_Z.sql">docs/sql/PAD_INVENTORY_QUERIES_A_TO_Z.sql</a></td><td>Reference SELECTs (inventory, barcode, stock)</td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="../sql/README.md">docs/sql/README.md</a></td><td>How to run</td></tr>
</table>
<p><strong>Oracle <code>SET_UNIQ_NO</code>:</strong> may be CLOB — use <code>LENGTH(TRIM(set_uniq_no)) &gt; 0</code> in SQL (see queries file section D–E).</p>
<h2>Environment checklist</h2>
<pre>
APP_URL=
DB_CONNECTION=
DB_HOST=
DB_DATABASE=
DB_USERNAME=
DB_PASSWORD=
PADMA_HRM_API_URL=
</pre>
<h2>Log / audit</h2>
<p>• <code>stock_out_gate_pass_logs</code> — gate pass prints  </p>
<p>• Transfer/swap tables — movement history</p>
<div class="page-break"></div><h1>Module 15 — Inventory Barcode (SET_UNIQ_NO)</h1>
<h2>Routes</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>URL</th><th>Name</th></tr>
<tr><td>GET</td><td><code>/inventory-barcode</code>, <code>/barcode-generate</code></td><td><code>inventory-barcode</code>, <code>barcode-generate</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/inventory-barcode-generate</code>, <code>/barcode-generate-by-item-id</code></td><td><code>inventory-barcode-generate</code></td></tr>
</table>
<h2>Flow</h2>
<p>1. User selects <strong>Division/Branch</strong> (required unless Item chosen) and optional <strong>Item</strong>. 2. <strong>QTY</strong>, <strong>Page Layout</strong>, optional <strong>Price</strong> / <strong>Brand</strong> on label. 3. <strong>Generate</strong> → same page shows <strong>vertical barcode preview</strong> (one label under another, thermal-style). 4. <strong>Print</strong> → one label per print page (<code>@page</code> size from Page Layout).</p>
<h2>Layers</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Layer</th><th>Class</th></tr>
<tr><td>Controller</td><td><code>InventoryBarcodeController</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Interface</td><td><code>InventoryBarcodeRepo</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Repository</td><td><code>InventoryBarcodeRepoImpl</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Label sizes</td><td><code>BarcodeLabelSizeCatalog</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Views</td><td><code>resources/views/backend/item/inventory_barcode/</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>CSS</td><td><code>public/backend/assets/css/barcode.css</code></td></tr>
</table>
<h2>Data rules</h2>
<p>• Barcode value: <strong><code>SET_UNIQ_NO</code></strong> (CODE128 via <code>picqer/php-barcode-generator</code>).</p>
<p>• Main row per set: <code>MAX(item_inventory.id)</code> grouped by <code>set_uniq_no</code>; exclude spec <code>item_id</code> <strong>17, 41, 12, 14</strong> (RAM, processor, HDD, SSD).</p>
<p>• Active rows: <code>status &lt;&gt; 9</code>.</p>
<p>• <strong>Oracle:</strong> filter non-empty set with <code>LENGTH(TRIM(set_uniq_no)) &gt; 0</code> (not <code>!= &#039;&#039;</code>).</p>
<p>• Branch filter: dropdown value <code>branch:{hr_branch_id}</code>; inventory matched via <code>branch.id</code> / <code>hr_branch_id</code> for that branch row only.</p>
<h2>SQL reference</h2>
<p>See <a href="../sql/PAD_INVENTORY_QUERIES_A_TO_Z.sql">docs/sql/PAD_INVENTORY_QUERIES_A_TO_Z.sql</a> sections <strong>D, E, F</strong>.</p>
</body></html>